        "stdout": "[\"Relative paths to modules may not traverse to parent directories (../x)\",\"module names must not have equal consecutive components: a/a\",\"Modules must be named by relative paths using '/', not '\\\\' (a\\\\b)\",\"Module path contains a NUL byte\",\"module not found: missing1868plain\"]\n",
        "stderr": ""
      },
      "flags": [
        "n",
        "c"
      ]
    },
    {
